<title>FRANCE: AGF gives further details of results.</title>
<headline>AGF gives further details of results.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>French insurer AGF gave</p>
<p>the following further details on its 1996 results:</p>
<p>    Total unrealised capital gains	  25.4 bln francs, up 70.5 pct</p>
<p>    ROE					     6.7 percent</p>
<p>    ROE before goodwill and exceptionals  9.5 percent</p>
<p>    Net earnings per share		    11.28 francs</p>
<p>    Net asset value per shr Dec 31, 1996  237 francs</p>
<p> -- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
